     "id": 1169316,
     "content_html": "the abolition of slavery in the state"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169315,
     "content_html": "a law outlawing the import of more enslaved people"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169314,
     "content_html": "the passage of legislation allowing slavery to disappear by attrition"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169317,
     "content_html": "a debate in the legislature about whether to abolish slavery"
